        <span class="font-display font-bold text-slate-50">QuotesDock</span>
        <span class="mx-2 text-slate-600">|</span>
        <span>Dedicated 60-second driveway quote &amp; job-proof pages for mobile car detailers.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
        <a href="#demo" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">Interactive Demo</a>
        <a href="#pricing" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">Pricing</a>
        <a href="/studio" class="text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-slate-200">
          Operator Studio
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
